# Compiled SPA bundle output (generated by tribinapp/deploy.ps1 -> `quasar build`).
# Do NOT ignore vendor libraries in the sub-folders (DataTables, tablesorter,
# bootstrap, select2, numeral, gijgo, ...) - those are committed source used by
# the legacy Blade views (resources/views/frame.blade.php, login.blade.php, ...).
